## submitted/ is to_submit/ after REL-17's rename. Ignored rather than tracked on
## purpose: ~52 MB of EPS figures, PDFs and an xlsx -- the as-submitted snapshot, not
## source. GIT-03/GIT-04 rewrote history specifically to get large generated blobs
## OUT, and committing these would put 52 MB back in permanently. build_public.sh:139
## already excludes it from the release, so tracking it would only bloat this repo.
## MAN-06 cites paths under it; tests/verify_docs.R treats a deliberately-gitignored
## citation as resolved, which is why this closes its assertion-2 findings.
/manuscript/submitted/
