## DOC-13: contents-level, not directory-level, so the negation below can work --
## a git negation cannot re-include a file inside an excluded *directory*. The base
## package has its own repo and is installed from it, so everything under here stays
## ignored EXCEPT CLAUDE.md, which is internal (Rob, 2026-09-02) and was previously
## tracked only in the PUBLIC base repo. This is now its only version-controlled home.
